#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerh743v1.rst:92
#: a668becb522944dda6b9df350e8db7c5
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "遥控输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerh743v1.rst:94
#: 21539e3ecf6e49e991bd86b3bb8f69de
msgid ""
"RC input is configured by default on the R1 (UART1_RX) pin. It supports all "
"serial RC protocols. For protocols requiring separate half-duplex serial to "
"transmit telemetry (such as FPort) you should setup SERIAL1 as an RC input "
"serial port, with half-duplex, pin-swap and inversion enabled "
"(:ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` = 15)."
msgstr ""
"遥控输入默认配置在R1（UART1_RX）引脚上，支持所有串行遥控协议。对于需要单独半双工串口发送数传的协议（如FPort），应将SERIAL1设置为RC输入串口，并启用半双工、引脚交换和反相（:ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>`"
" = 15）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerh743v1.rst:96
#: f7158c3078d54ed3ab056cde05e6b9f6
msgid ""
"The DJI connector also has UART4 RX input for DJI RC input. To use this you "
"would need to set :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` to something "
"other than \"23\" (RCinput) and set this protocol for "
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` instead."
msgstr ""
"DJI连接器还提供UART4 RX输入用于DJI遥控输入。使用时需将 :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>`"
" 改为「23」（遥控输入）以外的值，并将 :ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` 设置为该协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerh743v1.rst:98
#: 9295e2a547d74147a12588ac85c2e059
msgid ""
"For PPM support on UART4_RX set :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to 1 "
"and use the UART4 RX pin as PPM (and any other serial RC protocol) input."
msgstr ""
"要在UART4_RX上支持PPM，请将 :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设置为1，使用UART4 "
"RX引脚作为PPM（及其他串行遥控协议）输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerh743v1.rst:101
#: 1645184f8ad64f10932a4aa64163cf4d
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerh743v1.rst:103
#: 6eeae5480e514d9d8a30cbc8d24f653f
msgid ""
"The FoxeerH7 MPU6000 supports using its internal OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 "
"(MAX7456 driver). External OSD support such as DJI or DisplayPort is "
"supported using UART7 or any other free UART. See :ref:`common-msp-osd-"
"overview-4.2` for more info."
msgstr ""
"FoxeerH7 MPU6000支持使用OSD_TYPE "
"1（MAX7456驱动）的内部OSD。DJI或DisplayPort等外部OSD支持使用UART7或任何其他空闲UART。详情参见 "
":ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerh743v1.rst:106
